Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:01.83,Default,,0,0,0,,我开着我那大卡车
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.83,0:00:04.08,Default,,0,0,0,,酒都还没醒
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.08,0:00:08.13,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿，这减速带咋看着像活的
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.13,0:00:09.83,Default,,0,0,0,,不妙！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.83,0:00:11.88,Default,,0,0,0,,管他什么警察
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.88,0:00:16.17,Default,,0,0,0,,飙到一百迈再说！！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.17,0:00:17.79,Default,,0,0,0,,你怕是不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.79,0:00:20.08,Default,,0,0,0,,我油箱满着呢
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.08,0:00:24.08,Default,,0,0,0,,今天那小子死定了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.08,0:00:25.92,Default,,0,0,0,,看我不碾扁你！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.92,0:00:27.79,Default,,0,0,0,,开着我的卡车
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.79,0:00:31.04,Default,,0,0,0,,没人会看见
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.04,0:00:31.77,Default,,0,0,0,,受死吧！！
